# The repository is consumed on Linux: CI runners, the Docker image and `docker compose` all
# read these files through a POSIX shell. A CRLF `.env.example` sourced with `set -a && . ...`
# gives every value a trailing carriage return, which turns an API key digest into one that
# matches nothing -- so line endings here are correctness, not style.
#
# Everything text is stored and checked out LF, whatever the developer's platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touched.
*.png binary
*.npz binary
*.ico binary
